6. DRAMA PAGE STRUCTURE

Design a complete Drama Hub.

Possible sections:

Overview

Core information and visual identity.

Community

Posts and discussions specifically associated with the drama.

Episodes

Season and episode navigation.

Cast

Actors and their roles.

Media

Relevant images, videos and community media.

Activity

Recent conversations and fandom activity.

Do not turn every section into a row of generic cards.

