29. TMDB DATA SOURCE

For drama/actor/poster metadata, design the product around a provider abstraction.

The initial provider will be:

TMDB

TMDB can provide:

- TV metadata
- movie metadata
- actors
- posters
- backdrops
- logos
- image assets

The UI must NOT directly depend on TMDB-specific field names.

Internally use Hallyu's own media/catalog model.

Example:

TMDB

↓

Hallyu ingestion layer

↓

Supabase catalog

↓

Hallyu app

This allows another provider to be introduced later without redesigning the product.

Do not build the UI around live TMDB calls from every screen.

---

